    "body": "The dump identified the exact corruption: the carried-mask category helper gave `ITEMDATABASE_FILLOUT_ITEM_INFO` only two 64-bit output slots. The native writes at least six slots, so it overwrote the stack and triggered the `ERROR:FFFFFFFF` fast-fail. The buffer is now eight slots, and verification rejects the unsafe form.\n\nThe corrected development build is installed. Please relaunch normally. The Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#243 holster repair will run after its 15-second safe window; startup must remain stable through that point before this is accepted.",
